<item>
            <title>[MAHOUT-828] bin/mahout should only print classpath on request, not all the time</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/MAHOUT-828</link>
                <project id="12310751" key="MAHOUT">Mahout</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;This is a trivial change, but it changes the user experience.  Anybody care to keep the current (very) verbose output?&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
