                                <comments>
                            <comment id="13121650" author="tdunning" created="Thu, 6 Oct 2011 01:19:55 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;I will commit this in a day or so once comments have come in.  This patch was accidentally attached to &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/MAHOUT-829&quot; title=&quot;bin/mahout doesn&amp;#39;t match the way the packaged forms of Mahout are arranged&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;MAHOUT-829&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;MAHOUT-829&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; as well.  I have fixed that.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="13121688" author="lancenorskog" created="Thu, 6 Oct 2011 03:05:31 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Yes, please stop printing the classpath. Also, please export the classpath to the app in the CLASSPATH environment variable, not on the command line. On some unixes, there is a maximum length in the command line printed by &apos;ps -f&apos;. The classpath uses all of the space, and I can&apos;t see which mahout job is running.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="13122138" author="tdunning" created="Thu, 6 Oct 2011 18:26:56 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Committed this due to non-controversial nature.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;   mahout classpath&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;command will now print the classpath.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Also, the classpath is passed in the environment.  I expect that the command will still be too long to read, but it is a reasonable thing to try.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="13131506" author="srowen" created="Thu, 20 Oct 2011 10:24:18 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Ted I don&apos;t think you actually committed this to SVN. I&apos;ll apply it.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="13131595" author="hudson" created="Thu, 20 Oct 2011 13:12:58 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Integrated in Mahout-Quality #1106 (See &lt;a href=&quot;https://builds.apache.org/job/Mahout-Quality/1106/&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://builds.apache.org/job/Mahout-Quality/1106/&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;br/&gt;
    &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/MAHOUT-828&quot; title=&quot;bin/mahout should only print classpath on request, not all the time&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;MAHOUT-828&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;MAHOUT-828&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;srowen : &lt;a href=&quot;http://svn.apache.org/viewcvs.cgi/?root=Apache-SVN&amp;amp;view=rev&amp;amp;rev=1186717&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;http://svn.apache.org/viewcvs.cgi/?root=Apache-SVN&amp;amp;view=rev&amp;amp;rev=1186717&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
Files : &lt;/p&gt;
